#: ../../source/users/export&print/export_nomenclature.rst:4
msgid "Export nomenclature"
msgstr "导出物料清单"

#: ../../source/users/export&print/export_nomenclature.rst:6
msgid ""
"QElectroTech allows creating a CSV file which contains a list of all "
"`elements`_ from the active project. The CSV file can be opened and edited "
"with tools as `LibreOffice Calc`_."
msgstr ""
"QElectroTech 允许创建 CSV 文件，其中包含活动项目中所有 `元件 <elements_>`_ 的列表。可以使用 `LibreOffice"
" Calc <LibreOffice Calc_>`_ 等工具打开和编辑 CSV 文件。"

#: ../../source/users/export&print/export_nomenclature.rst:9
msgid ""
"The different field properties are listed by columns and the `elements`_ are"
" ordered by `folio`_."
msgstr "不同字段属性按列列出，`元件 <elements_>`_ 按 `图幅 <folio_>`_ 排序。"

#: ../../source/users/export&print/export_nomenclature.rst:11
msgid "To export the nomenclature list to CSV file:"
msgstr "要将物料清单列表导出为 CSV 文件："

#: ../../source/users/export&print/export_nomenclature.rst:13
msgid ""
"Select **Project > Export to CSV** menu item to open the exporting parameter"
" PopUp window."
msgstr "选择 **项目 > 导出为 CSV** 菜单项，以打开导出参数弹出窗口。"

#: ../../source/users/export&print/export_nomenclature.rst:18
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech project menu"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 项目菜单"

#: ../../source/users/export&print/export_nomenclature.rst:20
msgid ""
"Modify the list of information to be exported by the commands of the "
"following table."
msgstr "使用下表中的命令修改要导出的信息列表。"

#: ../../source/users/export&print/export_nomenclature.rst:23
msgid "Icon"
msgstr "图标"

#: ../../source/users/export&print/export_nomenclature.rst:23
msgid "Action"
msgstr "操作"

#: ../../source/users/export&print/export_nomenclature.rst:23
msgid "Keyboard shortcut"
msgstr "键盘快捷键"

#: ../../source/users/export&print/export_nomenclature.rst:25
msgid "|go-up|"
msgstr "|go-up|"

#: ../../source/users/export&print/export_nomenclature.rst:53
msgid "go-up"
msgstr "向上"

#: ../../source/users/export&print/export_nomenclature.rst:25
msgid "Move up this field"
msgstr "向上移动此字段"

#: ../../source/users/export&print/export_nomenclature.rst:26
msgid "|list-add|"
msgstr "|list-add|"

#: ../../source/users/export&print/export_nomenclature.rst:54
msgid "list-add"
msgstr "添加"

#: ../../source/users/export&print/export_nomenclature.rst:26
msgid "Add field to export list"
msgstr "向导出列表添加字段"

#: ../../source/users/export&print/export_nomenclature.rst:26
msgid "Double click on field at available list"
msgstr "双击可用列表中的字段"

#: ../../source/users/export&print/export_nomenclature.rst:27
msgid "|list-remove|"
msgstr "|list-remove|"

#: ../../source/users/export&print/export_nomenclature.rst:55
msgid "list-remove"
msgstr "移除"

#: ../../source/users/export&print/export_nomenclature.rst:27
msgid "Remove field from export list"
msgstr "从导出列表中删除字段"

#: ../../source/users/export&print/export_nomenclature.rst:27
msgid "Double click on field at export list"
msgstr "双击导出列表中的字段"

#: ../../source/users/export&print/export_nomenclature.rst:28
msgid "|go-down|"
msgstr "|go-down|"

#: ../../source/users/export&print/export_nomenclature.rst:52
msgid "go-down"
msgstr "向下"

#: ../../source/users/export&print/export_nomenclature.rst:28
msgid "Move down this field"
msgstr "下移这个字段"

#: ../../source/users/export&print/export_nomenclature.rst:34
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech export nomenclature PopUp window"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 导出物料清单弹出窗口"

#: ../../source/users/export&print/export_nomenclature.rst:36
msgid ""
"Define the filtering parameters (**Filter by** and type of `elements`_)."
msgstr "定义过滤参数（**Filter by** 和 `元件 <elements_>`_ 的类型）。"

#: ../../source/users/export&print/export_nomenclature.rst:40
msgid ""
"The content and filtering request configuration can be saved and chosen from"
" **Configuration** section to increase working efficiency."
msgstr "可由 **配置** 部分保存并选择内容与过滤请求配置，以提高工作效率。"

#: ../../source/users/export&print/export_nomenclature.rst:42
msgid ""
"QElectroTech is working with SQLite database, summary table content can also"
" be defined by SQL query."
msgstr "QElectroTech 使用 SQLite 数据库，汇总表内容也可以通过 SQL 查询来定义。"

#: ../../source/users/export&print/export_nomenclature.rst:44
msgid ""
"Define page layout parameters (include table header and type of format)."
msgstr "定义页面布局参数（包括表头和格式类型）。"

#: ../../source/users/export&print/export_nomenclature.rst:45
msgid ""
"Press **OK** button to apply exporting parameters and display the **Save "
"As** PopUp window."
msgstr "按下 **OK** 按钮应用导出参数，并显示 **另存为** 弹出窗口。"

#: ../../source/users/export&print/export_nomenclature.rst:46
msgid "Choose target directory and file name."
msgstr "选择目标目录和文件名。"

#: ../../source/users/export&print/export_nomenclature.rst:47
msgid "Press **Save** button to create the file with extension ``.csv``."
msgstr "按下 **保存** 按钮，创建扩展名为 ``.csv`` 的文件。"
